---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — FormSetu">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">Last updated 31 July 2026</p>

  <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <div class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-pass bg-pass-bg p-4">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-pass">Your photos never leave your device</h2>
      <p class="mt-1">Our resizing tools run entirely in your browser using your device's own processing. Your photo, signature and documents are never uploaded, transmitted, stored or seen by us.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">What we collect</h2>
    <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand which pages are visited. It does not use cookies and does not track individuals across websites. It records aggregate information such as page views, referring site, country and browser type.</p>
    <p>We do not ask for or store your name, email address, phone number, roll number, registration number or any other personal identifier.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Cookies</h2>
    <p>We do not set advertising or tracking cookies. Third-party services you navigate to from our links may set their own.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">External links</h2>
    <p>We link to official examination websites and to Amazon. Once you follow those links, their privacy policies apply, not ours.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Amazon Associates</h2>
    <p>FormSetu participates in the Amazon Associates Program. When you follow a product link, Amazon may set a cookie to attribute a purchase to us. We receive only aggregate commission data — never information about who you are or what you bought.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Children</h2>
    <p>This site is intended for people applying to examinations and is not directed at children under 13.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Changes</h2>
    <p>If we add advertising or any service that collects additional data, we will update this page and change the date above before doing so.</p>

    <p class="pt-2">Questions: <a href="mailto:contact@formsetu.com" class="font-semibold text-navy-700 underline">contact@formsetu.com</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>